N\nFessenden, North Dakota 58438-0097\nPhone: 701-547-3161\nFax: 701-547-3719\nContacts\nName\nTitle\nPhone\nEmail\nLaura Muscha\nTreasurer\n701-547-3161 Ext.\nlamuscha@nd.gov\nKarissa Dockter\nDeputy Treasurer\n701-547-3161 Ext.\nkldockter@nd.gov\nSee Home Page for Courthouse Hours\nThe office of the County Treasurer was created by the state constitution. Treasurers take office in May, are elected for four-year terms on a non-partisan ballot during November elections, and their salary is set by state statute and based on the population of the county. The full duties are listed in the North Dakota Century Code. Some duties include receiving all incoming money, balancing accounts, collect fees and fines, invest funds, and provide information to lending agencies.\nMore Information\nDiscount & First Half Information\nDrain Assessments\nExtension of Due Date for Property Taxes\nPaid Under Protest\nPenalty Chart For Property Taxes\nTrue and Full Value\nNews\nWELLS COUNTY TAX STATEMENTS ONLINE\nPay Taxes Online\nEvents\nShow more...\nJobs\nDownloads\nPaying Property Taxes Online\nTax Statements Online\nExtension of Due Date for Property Taxes\nDiscount & First Half Information\nShow more...\nLinks\nNorth Dakota State Tax Commissioner\nNorth Dakota State Land Department\nPayments in Lieu of Taxes BY State/County\nNorth Dakota Association of Counties\nNorth Dakota State\nShow more...\nPrev Next\nHome\nContact Us\nHistory\nCounty Meetings / Events\nDisclaimer\nPrivacy Policy\nLogin\nSite Map\n© Wells County, ND. All right reserved.\n-->\n-->",
